PixlAudio Cloud Studio worker (ghcr.io/redsn0w1877/pixl-cloud-worker)
=====================================================================

This container image is published publicly, which counts as distribution, so this file lists what it contains,
under which licence, and where each source lives. Licence texts are in /opt/pixl/LICENSES/ in the image
(cloud/runpod-worker/LICENSES/ in the repository). Exact model files, sizes and sha256 are in
/opt/pixl/weights.lock. Not legal advice; see the design's section 5 ("Licences") for the reasoning.

Worker code
-----------
src/pixl_worker/ (the handler, storage, audio, lyrics and deploy code in cloud/runpod-worker/) is part of
https://github.com/RedSn0w1877/PixlAudio-iOS and is covered by that repository's LICENSE.

